s1-p30 = prose (cons "What has been established remains useful only where its dependencies remain satisfied. Retained observations govern reuse; unknown inputs remain in symbolic residuals; a continuing interaction retains its continuation and already-issued effects. Communicating a definition together with its dependencies and rationale makes that construction available to another participant. Persistence, interaction, and decentralized exchange in §10 express this continuing use of knowledge. *Conductance* names the availability of established relations to have consequences in further activity, rather than a second substance or a scalar objective imposed on intelligence." nil)
